# Test: a command that also has subcommands states BOTH readings of its path
# VALIDATES: AC-5 -- the generated usage line is printed, then the child listing
# PREVENTS: an operator of a node that runs a command AND carries subcommands
#           reading only the navigation line, which never says the node itself
#           is executable

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze show bgp help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze show bgp
expect=stderr:contains=ze show bgp <command> [options]
expect=stderr:contains=Commands
expect=stderr:contains=decode
